Description: fast, keyboard-friendly X11 file manager in pure Python
 Cadet is a file manager for X11 written from scratch in Python using only
 python-xlib. It renders its entire UI with a software framebuffer that is
 pushed to the server with XPutImage, so it stays responsive even with very
 large directories.
 .
 Features:
  * keyboard-first navigation (arrows, typeahead search, F2 rename, etc.)
  * copy / cut / paste with a clipboard, trash via gio
  * background-thread file operations - the UI never blocks
  * sortable columns (name / size / mtime), hidden-file toggle
  * clickable path bar with editable path, navigation history
  * context menu and toolbar for mouse users

